{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذْ", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "said"}, {"text": "رَبُّكَ", "translation": "your Lord"}, {"text": "لِلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةِ", "translation": "to the angels"}, {"text": "إِنِّى", "translation": "Indeed, I (am)"}, {"text": "جَاعِلٌۭ", "translation": "going to place"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "translation": "the earth"}, {"text": "خَلِيفَةًۭ ۖ", "translation": "a vicegerent"}, {"text": "قَالُوٓا۟", "translation": "they said"}, {"text": "أَتَجْعَلُ", "translation": "Will You place"}, {"text": "فِيهَا", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "مَن", "translation": "(one) who"}, {"text": "يُفْسِدُ", "translation": "will spread corruption"}, {"text": "فِيهَا", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "وَيَسْفِكُ", "translation": "and will shed"}, {"text": "ٱلدِّمَآءَ", "translation": "[the] blood[s]"}, {"text": "وَنَحْنُ", "translation": "while we"}, {"text": "نُسَبِّحُ", "translation": "[we] glorify (You)"}, {"text": "بِحَمْدِكَ", "translation": "with Your praises"}, {"text": "وَنُقَدِّسُ", "translation": "and we sanctify"}, {"text": "لَكَ ۖ", "translation": "[to] You"}, {"text": "قَالَ", "translation": "He said"}, {"text": "إِنِّىٓ", "translation": "Indeed, I"}, {"text": "أَعْلَمُ", "translation": "[I] know"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "تَعْلَمُونَ", "translation": "you know"}], "sahih": "And [mention, O Muḥammad], when your Lord said to the angels, \"Indeed, I will make upon the earth a successive authority.\"1 They said, \"Will You place upon it one who causes corruption therein and sheds blood, while we exalt You with praise and declare Your perfection?\"2 He [Allāh] said, \"Indeed, I know that which you do not know.\""}